1. Create a College Table with columns like College Name,College Code,Courses,No of students per course. 
Insert values as needed. Write a query to get College Name which has "Mechatronics" course and also no of students  not lesser than 100.

create database College;
use college;
create table college(
    CLG_NAME varchar(30) not null,
    CLG_CODE int primary key,
    CLG_course varchar(10) not null,
    CLG_std int
);
desc college;
insert into college values
('SKCET',1099,'Mechtronics',10),
